<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1810] Keystore and truststore fails from config file</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1810</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The changes in the fix for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1319&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1319&lt;/a&gt; introduced a bug which makes setting path to keystore and truststore impossible.&lt;br/&gt;
The reason seems to be an incorrect use of getString() here&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1319/files#diff-69b17249ac9d265091d730130d973f4aR282&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1319/files#diff-69b17249ac9d265091d730130d973f4aR282&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
and here&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1319/files#diff-69b17249ac9d265091d730130d973f4aR311&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1319/files#diff-69b17249ac9d265091d730130d973f4aR311&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There should be no getString there, just &quot;path&quot; as it is.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
